      "message": "It turns out, this support was never added to the Zephyr shim.\n\nYou can add the following to [zephyr_host_commands.h](https://source.chromium.org/chromiumos/chromiumos/codesearch/+/HEAD:src/platform/ec/zephyr/shim/include/zephyr_host_command.h;l\u003d53)\n\n```\n#define DECLARE_PRIVATE_HOST_COMMAND(_command, _routine, _version_mask) \\\n\tstatic const STRUCT_SECTION_ITERABLE(                           \\\n\t\thost_command,                                           \\\n\t\t_CONCAT_4(_cros_hcmd_, EC_CMD_BOARD_SPECIFIC_BASE, _,   \\\n\t\t\t  _command)) \u003d {                                \\\n\t\t.handler \u003d _routine,                                    \\\n\t\t.command \u003d _command + EC_CMD_BOARD_SPECIFIC_BASE,       \\\n\t\t.version_mask \u003d _version_mask,                          \\\n\t}\n```",
